  "reflectionText": "Gideon divided the three hundred into three companies, put trumpets in one hand and torches in pitchers in the other. They blew the trumpets, broke the pitchers, lifted the torches, cried: the sword of the Lord and of Gideon. What is it to fight a battle with the breaking of clay jars in your hands?"
